        "The helper isPlainObject (true only for a non-null, non-array object whose prototype is null or Object.prototype) is defined inside src/tag/mapping/map.ts and re-exported from there for src/tag/mapping/real_map.ts, although it is a general-purpose utility. Move it into a new module src/common/object.ts as a named export isPlainObject with the same signature (data: unknown) => boolean and identical semantics; import it from \"../../common/object.ts\" in both mapping tag modules; remove the definition and its export from map.ts. Public behavior, the full test suite, lint and type-check must be unchanged. Source is under src/ (TypeScript); the package is built with npm run build and tests run with node --test \"test/core/**/*.test.mjs\" \"test/spec/*.test.mjs\".\n\nVisible acceptance check (it must pass; it is not the only criterion): npm run build && node acceptance/visible/check.mjs\nThe project's own tests run with: node --test test/core/**/*.test.mjs test/spec/*.test.mjs\nDo not modify anything under acceptance/visible/."
